   We did actually do this at least once on #irc under the "exquisite
corpse" (http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exquisite_Corpse) name (well,
the lojban equivalent of it).  One person secretly chooses a selbri,
and each of the others in order, a sumti.  Then all are revealed
simultaneously, and the resultant bridi is read out.   Hilarity
ensues.

